# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so without this a fresh clone would
# check every .rs file out as CRLF and the next `cargo fmt` -- pinned to LF in
# rustfmt.toml -- would rewrite all twenty of them. The formatter and the
# checkout have to agree, or one of them produces a diff on every clone.
*.rs text eol=lf
rustfmt.toml text eol=lf
